Plasma Settings 25.12.0
https://invent.kde.org/plasma/plasma-settings

The bundled ARM64 executable is built from the complete upstream source archive
source.tar.xz (SHA-256 bc286f2df392f377dbbacaa6e5629e8538500c3ed24ec6f45e6838cc6df62971)
with null-menu-item.patch. The archive retains upstream copyright notices and
LICENSES, including GPL-2.0-or-later, GPL-2.0-only, GPL-3.0-only,
LicenseRef-KDE-Accepted-GPL, BSD-2-Clause, CC0-1.0 and CC-BY-4.0.
The patch rejects an absent MenuItem before the categorized proxy dereferences it.
Build on an isolated Ubuntu 26.04 ARM64 environment with deb-src enabled using
build.sh. No original system executable is replaced.
